{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">彭皓鋒早年確診直腸癌第三期，直腸內發現約5厘米腫瘤。他一直保持積極態度面對病魔、接受治療。為了籌措醫療費用及負擔生活開支，彭皓鋒近日與家姐彭家麗北上登台，激罕同台合唱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9519fe69-047f-4ca4-9317-692c7a53f2f7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026IFPYzzdwBL1786588308.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9519fe69-047f-4ca4-9317-692c7a53f2f7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">見彭皓鋒在台上賣力獻唱，與彭家麗合唱經典名曲《從不喜歡孤單一個》，炒熱全場氣氛。演唱會片段在社交平台曝光後，不少內地網民留言指自己是首次知曉他們的「姊弟」關係，引發激烈討論。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d3d22642-722e-4f21-b1c1-fe9923bb99d3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026lYT2jjqMRh1786588308.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d3d22642-722e-4f21-b1c1-fe9923bb99d3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">抖音片段截圖</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c75e41a9-b99a-48db-bbcb-526b42d63089.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026q0HAtJSCRt1786588307.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c75e41a9-b99a-48db-bbcb-526b42d63089.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">抖音片段截圖</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T13:49:07.770156+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}